      "value": "I'd like to extend the suggestion to be able to filter anyone who's in Busy mode too.\nThere should be a way to mix filters, so you can get people who are in private worlds with \"join me\", but ignore those with \"ask me\" or \"online\" or \"busy\"... and any other combination you can think of.",
